  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ReadableNote
  text: 'LINE 4 ''HELD TOGETHER WITH TAPE'', ENGINEERS WARN

    Internal reports show the MTA has postponed power, signal and tunnel repairs on Line 4 for the third year running to cover budget cuts. ''It isn''t if it fails, it''s when,'' one engineer said. The MTA called the line ''safe and fully operational''.'
